        "v": 5,
        "title": "Add CODEOWNERS and ts-pattern dependency",
        "summary": "Introduced .github/CODEOWNERS to assign default reviewers (@brandonkachen, @jahooma) and added ts-pattern@5.3.1 to backend/package.json. This enables automated PR routing and resolves a missing dependency for pattern matching in backend code. The change affects repository governance and backend dependency manifest.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-15T19:08:47.784Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "When someone proposes a change to the code, the system will now automatically ask Brandon and Jahooma to review it, instead of leaving it up to chance or manual assignment. At the same time, the backend added a tool that helps it make decisions based on different patterns, which fixes a problem where a needed piece was missing and could have caused things to break. If you looked at the project right now, you would see these two behind-the-scenes updates already in place.",
